       selectedSignals.map(GET /signals/{vid}/{name}/history?from&to&limit=perPage*10)
       → adaptSignalHistoryResp → flatten → sort newest-first; local pagination (slice).

Composition (web):
  - PageContainer(title="Signal Log Viewer", subtitle="Query signal history from Postgres",
    actions=<VehicleSelect/>, copyLink); usePageTitle("Signal Log").
  - vehicleId === 0 → EmptyState(signalLog.noVehicle / signalLog.noVehicleDesc).
  - GlassPanel1: SignalSelector + Time Range RangePicker + Per Page Select + Query Button + records.
  - !hasQueried → EmptyState("Select signals and click Query" / "Choose one or more …").
  - else → SignalHistoryTable (paginated #/Timestamp/Signal/Value/Type rows).
  - anyError → AlertBanner(danger): "error.loadFailed: {message}".

